# Absolute-path literals kept on purpose (format: tools/paths.ts of the ay workspace). Everything else derives its paths.
# Paths inside container images and compose files (image filesystem, HOME of uid 10001, mount points), not host paths.
docker/*.Dockerfile
box/**
compose.yaml
compose.production.yaml
# systemd requires an absolute ExecStart; the unit documents the install location on the usa host.
infra/usa/*.service
# Dated record of the 2026-11-12 move to usa: names the directories as they were on the hosts.
MIGRATION.md
